{
  "slug": "circle-skills",
  "name": "Circle Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Ship stablecoin apps faster. Best-practice skills for USDC payments, cross-chain transfers, wallets, and smart contracts — plus Circle's MCP server for real-time SDK and documentation guidance.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **18 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (18): `accept-agent-payments` (Use when a developer wants to monetize an API, endpoint, service, model, dataset, tool, or agent-facing resource with…), `agent-wallet-policy` (View spending policy on a Circle agent wallet — per-transaction, daily, weekly, and monthly USDC caps via the…), `bridge-stablecoin` (Build USDC bridging with Circle App Kit or standalone Bridge Kit SDK and Crosschain Transfer Protocol (CCTP)), `fund-agent-wallet` (Fund a Circle agent wallet with USDC via the `circle` CLI), `pay-via-agent-wallet` (Use this skill when the user wants to call a paid API, look something up online, search for…), `recover-eco-funds` (Recover USDC from a legacy Circle CLI Gateway `--method eco` deposit whose fixed refund recipient is the SCA's…), `swap-tokens` (Build token swap functionality with Circle App Kit or standalone Swap Kit SDKs), `unify-balance` (Build unified cross-chain USDC balance management with Circle Unified Balance Kit SDK via App Kit (`@circle-fin/app-kit`) or standalone…), and 10 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `circle`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install circle-skills@claude-plugins-official` from `circlefin/skills` (`plugins/circle`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 18,
    "mcp": 1
  },
